From f1380a16c6a8afdb3265af4b997b72ad3f6c0b7f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nicole Muzzin <nicks@fuckin.email>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 06:13:45 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] cssom: CSSStartingStyleRule

Stylo now parses @starting-style for Servo, and reading cssRules of a
sheet that has one hit the unimplemented!() for it in CSSRule creation,
a crash reachable from any page. Implements the grouping rule interface
(https://drafts.csswg.org/css-transitions-2/#the-cssstartingstylerule-interface).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 components/script/dom/css/cssgroupingrule.rs  |  3 +
 components/script/dom/css/cssrule.rs          | 13 ++-
 .../script/dom/css/cssstartingstylerule.rs    | 83 +++++++++++++++++++
 components/script/dom/css/mod.rs              |  1 +
 .../webidls/CSSStartingStyleRule.webidl       |  8 ++
 5 files changed, 106 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 components/script/dom/css/cssstartingstylerule.rs
 create mode 100644 components/script_bindings/webidls/CSSStartingStyleRule.webidl

